<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Prompts for Long-COT Data Generation</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the warm-up stage in Section <a href="#S4.SS2" title="4.2 Table-R1 Framework ‣ 4 Methodology ‣ Can GRPO Boost Complex Multimodal Table Understanding?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>, some original solutions are too short to be divided into two parts. Therefore, we use the prompt, shown in Figure <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.3 Prompts for Long-COT Data Generation ‣ Appendix B More Details about Table-R1 ‣ Can GRPO Boost Complex Multimodal Table Understanding?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, to expand short-COT into long-COT formats.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.F6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="24.57" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 24.57" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,24.57) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 18.67 C 0 21.93 2.64 24.57 5.91 24.57 L 647.24 24.57 C 650.51 24.57 653.15 21.93 653.15 18.67 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 18.67 C 1.97 20.84 3.73 22.6 5.91 22.6 L 647.24 22.6 C 649.42 22.6 651.18 20.84 651.18 18.67 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.78 8.98)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:45.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.76" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="629.59"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
